Content-Type: application/json

{
    "movieId": "6a15d0ccb19cfa748aed1ebf"
}

### Get My Watchlist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMTVkMWQwMGUxZGQ5NGQ4NTY3ZGI3MSIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc3OTgxOTIwNSwiZXhwIjoxNzc5OTA1NjA1fQ.YtENeUtXdPSAa_Srn0mYjxZsOv3TGwQLPa9fN15Ov7k
### ==========================================
### 6. CATALOG SEARCH FEATURES (No Token Needed)
### ==========================================

### Search by Title Keyword (e.g., "cept")
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies/search?title=cept

### Search by Genre (e.g., "Sci-Fi")
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies/search?genre=Sci-Fi